stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> SourcePublished
  SourcePublished --> StageImported : DataOps import/rebind verified
  StageImported --> QuarantineReady : restore + migrations + OCR
  QuarantineReady --> ActivationReady : control evidence prepared
  ActivationReady --> Active : signed atomic pointer
  Active --> BackedUp : manual recovery-point receipt
  BackedUp --> RoundTripVerified : isolated restore passes
  RoundTripVerified --> PublicStage : approved auth exception + controls
  PublicStage --> RecoveryRetest : recovery contract changes
  RecoveryRetest --> RoundTripVerified : fresh isolated drill passes
  SourcePublished --> [*] : mutation or digest failure
  StageImported --> [*] : collision or incomplete set
  QuarantineReady --> [*] : activation not approved
